    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ntcqfys",
      "content": "Arunachal Pradesh is a biodiversity hotspot of global significance. It forms part of the Indo-Burma biodiversity hotspot and the Eastern Himalaya biodiversity hotspot. With over 80% of its area under forest cover, it harbours an astonishing variety of plant and animal life."
